This notebook builds a robust hybrid CNN model (ResNet50 + EfficientNet-B0) with strong regularization to reduce overfitting and target 98%+ accuracy depending on data quality. It includes:

- Strong augmentations, Mixup/CutMix, Label Smoothing, Weight Decay, Early Stopping
- AMP mixed precision, AdamW optimizer, OneCycleLR scheduler
- Full evaluation: confusion matrix, accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, ROC curves
- Training curves (accuracy & loss), best model saving

It supports datasets either as a folder of class subdirectories or via a CSV (`image_path`, `label`).

Tip: On Kaggle, enable GPU in the notebook settings for best performance.